@startuml
title Generation Pipeline — Writer→Scorer→Reviewer Sequence

actor User
participant "Job Detail View" as UI
participant "TanStack Query" as TQ
participant "IPC Main" as IPC
participant "Writer Agent" as Writer
participant "Scorer Agent (ATS)" as Scorer
participant "Reviewer Agent (Humanizer)" as Reviewer
participant "Mistral LLM" as LLM
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> UI : Click "Generate Resume"
UI -> TQ : useMutation: generateResume(searchId, jobId)
TQ -> IPC : invoke("document:resume:stream:<id>")
IPC --> TQ : { type: "start" }

== ITERATION 1 (Both Scorer AND Reviewer evaluate) ==

IPC -> DB : read career_profile, work_experiences, resume_draft
IPC -> DB : read jobs.description, research.*
IPC -> Writer : start(GenerationState)

Writer -> LLM : generate draft from inputs
LLM --> Writer : draft (streaming)
Writer --> IPC : { type: "chunk", content }
IPC --> TQ : stream chunks → UI updates editor

IPC -> Scorer : evaluate(draft, jobDescription)
Scorer -> LLM : score ATS match (keyword, quals, format, seniority)
LLM --> Scorer : { atsScore: 78, passed: false, feedback }
Scorer --> IPC : { type: "score", atsScore: 78 }
Scorer --> IPC : { type: "feedback", feedback: [...] }
IPC --> TQ : score + scorer feedback → UI panel

IPC -> Reviewer : evaluate(draft)
Reviewer -> LLM : detect AI tells, rate naturalness
LLM --> Reviewer : { humanScore: 62, passed: false, feedback, suggestions }
Reviewer --> IPC : { type: "score", humanScore: 62 }
Reviewer --> IPC : { type: "feedback", feedback: [...] }
Reviewer --> IPC : { type: "personalization", suggestions: [...] }
IPC --> TQ : score + reviewer feedback + suggestions → UI

note right of Writer
  Both Scorer AND Reviewer
  evaluate every iteration.
  Combined feedback routes
  to Writer for next iteration
  if either score is below threshold.
end note

== ITERATION 2 (Writer revises with combined feedback) ==

IPC -> Writer : regenerate(draft, scorerFeedback, reviewerFeedback)
Writer -> LLM : regenerate with all feedback
LLM --> Writer : updated draft (streaming)
Writer --> IPC : { type: "chunk", content }
IPC --> TQ : stream chunks

IPC -> Scorer : evaluate(updatedDraft, jobDescription)
Scorer -> LLM : re-score ATS match
LLM --> Scorer : { atsScore: 92, passed: true }
Scorer --> IPC : { type: "score", atsScore: 92, iteration: 2 }

IPC -> Reviewer : evaluate(updatedDraft)
Reviewer -> LLM : re-check AI tells
LLM --> Reviewer : { humanScore: 85, passed: true, suggestions }
Reviewer --> IPC : { type: "score", humanScore: 85, iteration: 2 }
Reviewer --> IPC : { type: "personalization", suggestions: [...] }
IPC --> TQ : scores + suggestions → UI

== COMPLETE (both thresholds passed) ==

IPC -> DB : INSERT OR REPLACE INTO adapted_resumes (content + scores)
IPC --> TQ : { type: "done", result: { atsScore: 92, humanScore: 85 } }
TQ --> UI : show final document + scores
UI --> User : Resume ready — ATS 92%, AI Detection Low

@enduml
